{"type":"text","timestamp":1778976593987,"sessionID":"ses_1ccbc19d4ffeMhaCiVvygDpbuM","part":{"id":"prt_e33448947001zz53xAc8MW77fD","messageID":"msg_e33446cca00176f42c9Ci9oLo5","sessionID":"ses_1ccbc19d4ffeMhaCiVvygDpbuM","type":"text","text":"I’ve confirmed the replacement term exists and the cited review explicitly says the original Glass family was later shown to have the FGFR3 P250R mutation of Muenke syndrome. I’m editing the term as an obsoletion-with-replacement and then I’ll run MONDO normalization/validation.","time":{"start":1778976590151,"end":1778976593985}}}
